---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import patrickHeadshot from '../assets/patrick-headshot.jpg';
import { contactEmail } from '../site-config';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Alamo Agents"
  description="Why Alamo Agents exists, and who's building it."
>
  <section class="page-hero on-light">
    <div class="wrap reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Agents, out loud, in a room.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Most breakthroughs don't happen alone. They happen because someone showed their terminal,
        their notebook, their late-night debugging session to another builder who pushed back on
        it. Alamo Agents is that room: show up, demo what you're building, compare notes, and
        leave with better ideas than you walked in with.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap founder-wrap reveal">
      <div class="founder-head">
        <Image class="founder-avatar" src={patrickHeadshot} alt="Patrick Robinson" width={176} height={176} />
        <p class="eyebrow">Who's behind this</p>
        <h2>I'm building this to get people in a room, not just a feed.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-body">
        <p class="lede">
          I'm Patrick, a software consultant at{' '}
          <a href="https://leantechniques.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lean TECHniques</a>
          {' '}based here in San Antonio, where I coach teams on AI and agent frameworks. I'm also
          the founder of <a href="https://onpardev.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">On PAR Dev</a>,
          building agent systems and AI-assisted developer tools of my own. I'm trying to get the people
          doing that work in the same room, on purpose, on a regular basis, instead of trading
          screenshots online. San Antonio has the engineers and the founders doing this work. I'm
          building the room where they show up together.
        </p>
        <p class="lede">
          Questions, ideas, want to help host? Reach us at{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Two columns on desktop: avatar + heading | body copy (readable ~70ch). */
  .founder-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .founder-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
      gap: 64px;
    }

    .founder-body {
      padding-top: 104px;
    }
  }

  .founder-head h2 {
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .founder-avatar {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .founder-avatar {
    width: 88px;
    height: 88px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid rgba(17, 19, 21, 0.14);
  }

  .lede + .lede {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
</style>
